# No server-side environment variables required.
# This app communicates directly with the Zotero API from the browser.
# Users will provide their own User ID and API Key (secret) within the app UI.
# 
# To get your Zotero API Key:
# 1. Go to https://www.zotero.org/settings/keys
# 2. Click 'Create new private key'
# 3. Ensure 'Allow library access' is checked
